From: Enrique Magallon <dev.ace.93.03@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:59:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Follow workspace_wraparound in the overview swipe

cosmic-comp wraps its own workspace swipe and next/previous shortcuts
from the last workspace to the first (and back) when
`workspace_wraparound` is on, which is the default. The overview swipe
now does the same: the strip position is unbounded, pages map to
workspaces modulo the count, and the settle animation keeps the lap so
it slides across the seam instead of rewinding. With the option off it
keeps the rubber band at both ends.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Hjqk95EtWyxLg63zr44Nju
